          "text": "ratio $= I^{2}R_{Y}/I^{2}R_{Z}$ or $(V_{Y}^{2}/R_{Y})/(V_{Z}^{2}/R_{Z})$ or $(V_{Y}I)/(V_{Z}I)$ $= 2$",
          "guidance": null
        }
